HIVE-FSA-003 — Project Falcon: Orphaned Evidence

Difficulty: Extreme
Evidence File: HIVE-FSA-003boardminutes.doc

Scenario
During an investigation into unauthorized disclosure of confidential executive information at HIVE CONSULT Minerals Ghana Limited, investigators recover a file named:
board_minutes.doc
The file is presented as an ordinary Microsoft Word meeting-minutes document relating to Project Falcon.
Initial examination suggests that the file is not quite what its extension claims. After recovering the apparent document, investigators discover that the visible contents appear completely ordinary and specifically state that no executive photographs are attached.
However, intelligence from the investigation indicates that a confidential executive boardroom photograph may still be concealed somewhere inside the evidence.
